-+<div class="textblock"><p>Represents the <span class="tt">ol</span> <span class="tt">ul</span> and <span class="tt">menu</span> tags, usage is the same as List&lt;<em>T</em> &gt;. </p>
-+<p>Set the <a class="el" href="namespaceCFlat_1_1Html_1_1Collections.html#aa43c293aa9a608578130e885676bfe51">Ordering</a> to <a class="el" href="namespaceCFlat_1_1Html_1_1Collections.html#aa43c293aa9a608578130e885676bfe51a26e09a1ee1517389c7b07f42df65561a">Ordering.Ordered</a> to generate a <span class="tt">ol</span>, <a class="el" href="namespaceCFlat_1_1Html_1_1Collections.html#aa43c293aa9a608578130e885676bfe51a288d468c5e0969f26a310773eda65603">Ordering.Unordered</a> to generate an <span class="tt">ul</span>, and <a class="el" href="namespaceCFlat_1_1Html_1_1Collections.html#aa43c293aa9a608578130e885676bfe51ab61541208db7fa7dba42c85224405911">Ordering.Menu</a> to generate a <span class="tt">menu</span>.</p>
