+<div><div class="header">
+  <div class="headertitle"><div class="title">README </div></div>
+</div><!--header-->
+<div class="contents">
+<div class="textblock"><p><img src="./cflat_logo.png" alt="Logo" class="inline"/></p>
+<h1 class="doxsection"><a class="anchor" id="autotoc_md0"></a>
+C Flat</h1>
+<p>A Web framework written in C#.</p>
+<h2 class="doxsection"><a class="anchor" id="autotoc_md1"></a>
+Features</h2>
+<h3 class="doxsection"><a class="anchor" id="autotoc_md2"></a>
+Current</h3>
+<ul>
+<li>Http server that routes and renders your code</li>
+<li>A boat load of classes</li>
+</ul>
+<h3 class="doxsection"><a class="anchor" id="autotoc_md3"></a>
+Planned</h3>
+<ul>
+<li>Cookie support</li>
+<li>Javascript</li>
+<li>CSS</li>
+</ul>
+<h2 class="doxsection"><a class="anchor" id="autotoc_md4"></a>
+License</h2>
+<p>This project is licensed under the <a href="https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mpl-2.0/">MPL-2.0</a>.</p>
+<h2 class="doxsection"><a class="anchor" id="autotoc_md5"></a>
+Run Locally</h2>
+<p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Git, .NET 9.0 SDK or later, make(optional)</p>
+<p>Clone the project: </p><div class="fragment"><div class="line">git clone https://github.com/githubdex59/cflat.git</div>
+</div><!-- fragment --><p> Change directories into it: </p><div class="fragment"><div class="line">cd cflat</div>
+</div><!-- fragment --><p> Run the test program: </p><div class="fragment"><div class="line">make test</div>
+</div><!-- fragment --> </div></div><!-- contents -->
+</div><!-- PageDoc -->
+</div><!-- doc-content -->
+<div id="page-nav" class="page-nav-panel">
+<div id="page-nav-resize-handle"></div>
+<div id="page-nav-tree">
+<div id="page-nav-contents">
+</div><!-- page-nav-contents -->
+</div><!-- page-nav-tree -->
+</div><!-- page-nav -->
